Note: EPL String Package — Usage Examples
Use "epl-string"

Note: --- Case Conversion ---
Print to_camel_case("hello world example")
Print to_pascal_case("hello world example")
Print to_snake_case("helloWorldExample")
Print to_kebab_case("helloWorldExample")
Print to_constant_case("helloWorld")
Print to_title_case_smart("the quick brown fox and the lazy dog")

Note: --- Text Analysis ---
Print "Levenshtein distance (kitten, sitting):"
Print levenshtein_distance("kitten", "sitting")

Print "Similarity ratio:"
Print similarity_ratio("hello", "hallo")

Print "Is anagram (listen, silent):"
Print is_anagram("listen", "silent")

Print "Character frequency:"
Print char_frequency("hello world")

Note: --- Transformation ---
Print word_wrap("The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog near the river bank", 20)
Print rot13("Hello World")
Print caesar_cipher("ABC", 3)
Print reverse_words("hello beautiful world")

Note: --- Templates ---
Create greeting equal to template_replace("Hello {{name}}, you are {{age}} years old!", Map with name = "Alice" and age = 30)
Print greeting

Print pluralize("cat", 5)
Print pluralize("box", 3)
Print ordinalize(1)
Print ordinalize(22)
Print ordinalize(11)

Note: --- Validation ---
Print is_palindrome("race car")
Print count_vowels("Hello World")
